```

## Scripts

- `pnpm dev` - Start development servers
- `pnpm build` - Build applications
- `pnpm docker:up` / `pnpm docker:down` - Docker Compose

Run `pnpm install` at the project root before `docker compose build` if you used `--no-install` during create.

